{"date":"2026-10-03","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Sunil says: “Twenty rupees, sir. Sit on the plastic stool, don't stand there like a statue; the steam is good for the head, even if the road dust isn't.” Slides the steel glass across the counter and wipes a smudge from the metal.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8"},"reference":"9defb996378295bb4a54a88295f8efa809ed3c7cd5a8cc6e82aaf8a1e204445d","time":"08:50","typed_records":[{"amount":300,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"the dhobi","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-03:payment:5f0510f65c08c4bb:1","item":"The dhobi","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"5f0510f65c08c4bbe235c71a07c07d442d402358f2594de234a43a8f129ac960"},"time":"05:57"},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:893d0a5cf56642d6:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"893d0a5cf56642d6c019d15c8ca1896824cdd2fa8d29b8fe5f86ad55b830afd5"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:30","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, has any paper come from the Directorate, or any message from Shri Hegde, since yesterday? And breakfast at seven, please, when it is ready."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:7a510431a74347ab:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":5,"sha256":"7a510431a74347abe2a82c0f076b89bc8b6c21aa0fb3a5426924fb87605f28d0"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:30","verified":false,"words":"No papers, sir. The office is closed on weekends. Breakfast will be ready at seven sharp."},{"id":"2026-10-03:statement:b2b12f3d098e6a1a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"b2b12f3d098e6a1a7a087fa5e3cb0c4bb2377aa3366388b52896e53b52771cee"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:40","verified":false,"words":"Seven, then. Keep the tea strong, and let th